Package: calval
Title: Validate Calibrated Sensor Performance
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Danielle", 
    family = "Dempsey", 
    email = "ddempsey@perennia.ca",
    role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Nicole", 
    family = "Torrie", 
    email = "ntorrie@perennia.ca", 
    role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Danielle Dempsey <ddempsey@perennia.ca>
Description: Facilitates calibration validation of Water Quality sensors deployed for CMAR's Coastal Monitoring Program. (Compatible sensors: Hobo Pro V2, Hobo DO, Hobo pH, aquaMeasure DOT, aquaMeasure SAL). Researchers can verify whether sensors are operating within an acceptable range prior to and after sensor deployment.
